s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Get the decision after r&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;evised/ re-revised manuscript &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;checking process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
